From 80daeae0852e3f46a6ebfa5b47c13aeb2689b592 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:36:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/12] feat(wire): qualify cardinal DXF circle entries and
 bounded radii

Check the exact radial line through the threading hole. Use the original center and diameter at 6 to 15 mm radius for the qualified 1 mm circular separation.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

